package(USEPKG LOKI G4GeoLoki SimpleHists USEEXT h5py)

######################################################################

Output files of LOKI simulations for the ESS data reduction tools (scipp):
sb_lokioutput_writehdf5 writes the simulated counts per pixel of analysis outputs
(sb_loki_ana) into an HDF5 file readable with h5py and scipp (see
python/Hdf5Output.py and data/hdf5_scipp_snippet.py).

Needs the Python module h5py (extdeps/ExtDep_h5py.cmake): without it, this
package is not built.

Primary author: milan.klausz@ess.eu
